---
/**
 * Política de privacidad (/privacy/). No existe en Figma: se agregó el 2026-11-20 porque
 * las condiciones de Google Analytics exigen informar su uso.
 *
 * Texto redactado con los datos reales del sitio y aprobado por el cliente (2026-11-21).
 * Si se cambia, actualizar `lastUpdated`.
 *
 * Diseño: mismos tokens, tipografías y header/footer del home; una columna de lectura
 * sobre el navy de las secciones oscuras.
 */
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';

const { name, coverageArea } = siteConfig.company;
const email = siteConfig.contact.email;
const lastUpdated = 'November 21, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${name}`}
  description={`How ${name} collects, uses, and protects information from visitors to its website and people who contact the agency.`}
>
  <Header />

  <main id="top" class="privacy">
    <article class="privacy__inner">
      <header class="privacy__intro">
        <p class="privacy__kicker">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="privacy__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy__updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <p>
        {name} ("we," "us," or "our") is a private investigation agency based in South Florida,
        serving {coverageArea}. Discretion is at the core of our work, and we apply the same
        principle to the information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains what
        information we collect through this website and when you contact us, how we use it, and the
        choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you choose to share with us</h3>
      <p>
        This website does not include contact forms or user accounts. We only receive personal
        information when you decide to contact us by phone, WhatsApp, or email. In that case, we
        receive the information you provide, such as your name, phone number, email address, and the
        details of your situation.
      </p>
      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>
        When you visit this website, some information is collected automatically to help us
        understand how the site is used. This includes pages visited, time spent on the site, the
        website or search engine that referred you, your approximate location (city or region), and
        general information about your device and browser, such as device type, operating system,
        browser, and screen size.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide a confidential consultation.</li>
        <li>To provide the investigative services you request from us.</li>
        <li>
          To understand how visitors use this website and improve its content and performance.
        </li>
        <li>To comply with our legal and professional obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information.</p>

      <h2>Confidentiality of your inquiry</h2>
      <p>
        We treat every inquiry as confidential, whether or not you decide to hire us. Information
        you share during a consultation is used only to evaluate and, if you engage our services,
        carry out your case. It is not disclosed to third parties except when you authorize it or
        when we are required to do so by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses Google Analytics, a web analytics service provided by Google LLC, to
        measure traffic and usage. Google Analytics uses cookies (small text files stored in your
        browser) and similar technologies to collect the automatic information described above. This
        information is aggregated and helps us understand how the site is used; we do not use it to
        identify you personally.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can learn more about how Google uses this information at
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services
        </a>
        . You can prevent Google Analytics from collecting your data by installing the
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on
        </a>
        , or by blocking or deleting cookies in your browser settings.
      </p>
      <p>This website does not use advertising cookies or show third-party ads.</p>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        We rely on a limited number of trusted providers to operate this website and our
        communications:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Google</strong> — website analytics (Google Analytics).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Hostinger</strong> — website hosting and email. As with any website, the hosting
          server may keep standard technical logs (such as IP address, browser type, and date and
          time of access) for security and operation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>WhatsApp (Meta)</strong> — if you choose to contact us through WhatsApp, your
          messages are also subject to WhatsApp's own privacy policy.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These providers process information on our behalf or under their own privacy policies, and
        only to the extent needed to provide their services.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the information you share with us only for as long as necessary to respond to your
        inquiry, provide our services, and meet our legal and professional obligations. We take
        reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect your information. However, no
        method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may contact us at any time to ask what personal information we hold about you, or to
        request that we correct or delete it, subject to any information we are required to keep by
        law. You can also control cookies through your browser settings or the opt-out option
        described above.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for adults and is not directed to children under 13. We do not
        knowingly collect personal information from children through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
      <p>
        This website may contain links to other websites or social media platforms. We are not
        responsible for the privacy practices of those sites, and we encourage you to review their
        privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page
        with an updated "Last updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your information,
        please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="privacy__back">
        <a href="/">← Back to home</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    background: radial-gradient(154% 120% at 81% 0%, #0d2743 0%, #021124 100%);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem) 1.5rem clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  }

  .privacy__inner {
    max-width: 45rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .privacy__intro {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(229, 181, 77, 0.25);
  }

  .privacy__kicker {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .privacy__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .privacy__updated {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(229, 181, 77, 0.75);
  }

  .privacy h2 {
    margin: 2.75rem 0 0.875rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 3vw, 1.625rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .privacy h3 {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-gold-light);
  }

  .privacy p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .privacy ul {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .privacy li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy li::marker {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .privacy strong {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .privacy a {
    color: var(--color-gold-light);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(229, 181, 77, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .privacy a:hover,
  .privacy a:focus-visible {
    text-decoration-color: currentColor;
  }

  .privacy__back {
    margin-top: 3rem !important;
  }

  .privacy__back a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
